      "text": "Spend 12 days travelling from Patagonia’s glaciers and the shores of Tierra del Fuego to Iguazú Falls and the warmth of Rio. Along the way, see a tango show in Buenos Aires, visit Perito Moreno Glacier and Tierra del Fuego National Park, and explore both sides of the falls, Sugarloaf Mountain and Corcovado. Travel dates: 28 February to 11 March 2027."
